{
  "version": 4,
  "note": [
    "Vectors for the check and fold a circuit applies to a value before it",
    "hashes it into a node. Tags and buffers are in platforms.json. Each",
    "language implements the transform. The circuit's keys a binding, so the",
    "others must match it on every vector.",
    "",
    "A value is the JSON token exactly as the platform sent it. A handle, or an",
    "id of idShape `string`, is printable ASCII 0x20-0x7e without '\"' or '\\',",
    "so a value between revealed quotes is one string. An id of idShape",
    "`decimal` is digits 0-9. A handle folds A-Z to a-z and nothing else. An id",
    "is never folded. Nothing is trimmed.",
    "",
    "A node is SHA256(tag || value), with no separator or length prefix: the",
    "handle node over the folded handle, the id node over the id as sent."
  ],
  "errors": [
    {
      "key": "Empty",
      "note": "Zero bytes."
    },
    {
      "key": "TooLong",
      "note": "More bytes than the platform's buffer in platforms.json."
    },
    {
      "key": "BadCharacter",
      "note": "A byte outside printable ASCII, a quote, a backslash, or a non-digit in a decimal id."
    }
  ],
